{"id":"615991","name":"素包子","author":"桥母夏雨_AELmLa","authorId":"9419600","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615991/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"韭黄","amount":"半斤"},{"name":"香茹","amount":"八朵"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"八片"},{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"一根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"三个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"两勺"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"两勺"},{"name":"耗油","amount":"两勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所有食材。","img":"images/615991/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香茹，木耳，红萝卜焯水。","img":"images/615991/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"我是先焯水再切碎。","img":"images/615991/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋炒碎，油略大。","img":"images/615991/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"全部切碎。","img":"images/615991/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"调料。","img":"images/615991/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"馅。","img":"images/615991/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香味出来了。","img":"images/615991/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"今天用的发酵粉。","img":"images/615991/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"这个步骤略了，大家都知道。","img":"images/615991/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包好后再次醒发。","img":"images/615991/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"上锅，水开12分钟。","img":"images/615991/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"不错。","img":"images/615991/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"味道也不错。","img":"images/615991/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"1.配个油碟更好，今天我没油辣椒了。\n2.素包子能用很多菜成馅，大家不妨试试。在冬天素包子配个热汤很舒服。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}